            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "breeze88"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So good! I used jalepeno refried beans because I love them and I put a little of the salsa in the bean and avocado mixture while it was cooking. It totally fills you up and the avocado tastes so great and the feta cheese is the perfect compliment to the other flavors!",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-04T07:40:47.887Z"
          },
          {
